# Build context for docker/Dockerfile.kali is the REPO ROOT (so the Dockerfile can
# COPY the real brukal/*.py egress-proxy modules instead of vendoring stale copies).
# Keep the context lean: only brukal/*.py and docker/* are actually COPYed in.
.git
.venv
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
*.egg-info
tests
docs
*.log
docker/vpn
docker/vault
